          "heading": "Kepu Tuipulotu a doubt for Australia opener after knee injury in training",
          "body": "Hooker Kepu Tuipulotu is a doubt for England's autumn campaign after a knee injury picked up in national training on Tuesday. The uncapped 21-year-old had been tipped to make his England breakthrough this autumn, but it is understood he will not be in the squad for the opener with Australia, and his return timeframe is unclear. Tuipulotu, who joined Bath's academy in 2024, also qualifies for Wales, the country of his birth, but chose to focus on England."
