          "kicker": "Disciplinary ruling",
          "heading": "Tadhg Furlong cleared of groin-grab citation, available for Ireland's November Tests",
          "body": "Tadhg Furlong has been cleared by a disciplinary committee of grabbing Gavin Coombes in the groin during Leinster's URC win over Munster, with the complaint against the Ireland prop dismissed after a hearing on Thursday. The panel unanimously concluded he did not commit foul play under Law 9.27, though it described Coombes' account as an honest recollection. Furlong, 33, avoided a sanction and is available for Ireland's Nations Championship home matches against Argentina, Fiji and South Africa, plus the finals weekend at Twickenham."
