          "body": "Italy Under 18s are the story today: technical director Alessandro Lodi has named his XV for Saturday's test against Ireland at Badia Polesine, in the Rovigo province. Lodi said he expects an intense game at high tempo and under pressure, and wants his players to show courage, personality and their own style of play. The fixture is a year on from the last meeting, a 54-14 Italy win in Cosenza."
