          "heading": "Macs Page earns Wales call-up as injured Rio Dyer's replacement",
          "body": "Scarlets wing Macs Page has been called into Wales' squad to replace the injured Dragons wing Rio Dyer, and Scarlets director of rugby Nigel Davies expects his first cap to come \"sooner rather than later\". The 21-year-old has scored five tries this season, and could make his debut against Japan after a head knock in Scarlets' 52-40 defeat by the Stormers. He was helped off with oxygen but returned to light training before joining Wales, Davies said. Page previously toured Japan with Wales in 2025."
