          "body": "Thomas Gallo, the Lyon prop, has been lost to injury, and Rodrigo Martínez (Dragons) has been brought onto Argentina's 33-man roster for the London camp, reported on 25 October. Santiago Carreras was also lost to injury, with Mateo Soler (Dogos) taking his place. Gallo's injury timeline has not been reported in today's coverage, so whether he is available for the Nations Championship remains open. Felipe Contepomi will name his November squad after the camp."
