          "body": "Wallabies coach Les Kiss has made clear Kurtley Beale is in contention for the World Cup, not just to fill a void on the spring tour. The 37-year-old, who has 95 Test caps, was added after Hunter Paisami withdrew for personal reasons. \"He's in there to perform,\" Kiss said, and he will reassess the No. 10 position after the next Super Rugby Pacific season. The tour takes in Tests against England, Scotland and Wales."
